@startuml UC-A1-sign-in-design-sequence
!include ../../domain/diagrams/_style.puml
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 120
skinparam ParticipantPadding 8
skinparam BoxPadding 4
title UC-A1 Sign in (design sequence), steps 1 to 8
' Design level (decision 9), drawn against docs/domain/diagrams/bff-design.puml (decisions 5 and 12).
' Step numbers are the main flow numbers of UC-A1 (1 to 10). Steps 9 and 10 (first API call, landing, later requests)
' are in UC-A1-sign-in-design-sequence-later-requests.puml, because one page cannot hold them. Analysis level: UC-A1-sign-in-analysis-sequence.puml.
' BUILT: everything not marked PLANNED. PLANNED (decision 12, not built): marked "PLANNED" in the text and the
' notes: the state check in the use case before the exchange, attempts found by state, ending this browser's
' earlier session, the deactivated page and ending both sessions, the log lines (SecurityLog, NFR-5).
' Not drawn: Keycloak's login page, the log line of every branch (one note says they all log), pages and components.
' "IdentityProvider" is the BFF port (sign in, refresh, end session), not the API port of the same name.

actor "Person" as P
participant "Routes" as R #E6F0FB
participant "SignIn" as SI #E7F4EA
participant "IdentityProvider\n(Keycloak)" as IDP #EEE7F7
participant "LoginAttempt-\nStore" as LAS #EEE7F7
participant "Session-\nStore" as SS #EEE7F7
participant "Keycloak" as K #ECECEC

P -> R : 1 ask to sign in, /auth/login
R -> SI : startLogin(returnTo)
SI -> SI : 2 safeReturnTo(returnTo)
SI -> IDP : 2 beginLogin()
IDP -> K : discovery
alt Keycloak unreachable (AC-44)
  K --> IDP : no answer
  IDP --> R : error
  R --> P : /login?error=\nidentity_provider_unavailable
else
  IDP --> SI : redirectTo, state, nonce, verifier
  SI -> LAS : 2 save(attemptId, attempt)
  SI --> R : attemptId, redirectTo
  R --> P : 2 login cookie, redirect to Keycloak
end
P -> K : 3 email and password
K --> P : 4 redirect back with code, state
P -> R : 5 /auth/callback + login cookie
R -> SI : finishLogin(cookie, URL)
SI -> LAS : 5 take(attemptId), once only
note right of LAS
  PLANNED: find it by state
end note
alt no valid attempt (AC-38, AC-42)
  R --> P : redirect /?error=login_expired
else
  SI -> SI : 5 isExpired, state\n(state: PLANNED)
  alt Keycloak sent an error (AC-39)
    R --> P : redirect /?error=login_refused
  else
    SI -> IDP : 6 completeLogin()
    IDP -> K : 6 exchange code + PKCE verifier
    K --> IDP : access, refresh, ID tokens
    IDP -> IDP : 6 check nonce
    alt exchange or nonce fails (AC-39)
      IDP --> R : error, login_failed
      R --> P : redirect /?error=login_failed
    else
      IDP --> SI : Session (the tokens)
      SI -> SS : 7 put(newSessionId, session)
      note right of SS
        PLANNED: end the earlier session
      end note
      SI --> R : sessionId, returnTo
      R --> P : 7 session cookie, 8 redirect to returnTo
    end
  end
end
note over R, K
  Built: all, but the state check is inside completeLogin.
  PLANNED: what is marked, and a SecurityLog line for
  each refusal and session start or end (NFR-5).
  Steps 9 and 10: the later-requests diagram.
end note
@enduml
